      "01-06: 99 × 1.47 ÷ (99 × 1.40) = 1.05",
      "01-07: split 2:1 counted back, 50 × 2 ÷ 1 = 100; 100 × 1.47 ÷ (99 × 1.47) = 100/99",
      "01-08, 01-09: 1",
      "2026: 1.05 × 100/99 − 1 = 105/99 − 1 = 2/33 = 0.060606…",
